"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f3/3w05g36nf6loj65mpuebfklippztw5e.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%B3%95%E7%90%B3%E7%9A%84%E7%A5%9D%E7%A6%8F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f3/3w05g36nf6loj65mpuebfklippztw5e.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%B3%95%E7%90%B3%E7%9A%84%E7%A5%9D%E7%A6%8F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f3/3w05g36nf6loj65mpuebfklippztw5e.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />法琳的祝福\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（支援）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]，使自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有友军的<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]转换为随机[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"2级属性增益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">2级属性增益</font></span></span>]，并获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免疫属性减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免疫属性减益</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。技能释放后，若目标没有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]，则回复施法者魔攻值<font color=\"#58cb48\">40%</font>的生命值，并获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲伤害2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲伤害2</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-0 3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/ae/hp9k0iltoe2iq8n6u80ny5dwrlv7l6n.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-0_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/ae/hp9k0iltoe2iq8n6u80ny5dwrlv7l6n.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%B3%95%E7%90%B3\" title=\"角色图鉴库/法琳\"><img alt=\"头像 法琳.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d3/e7vicv4u9z1q40vk6ksy59htc7oa637.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\